{"id":"cuidado","lemma":"cuidado","pos":"noun","rank":273,"glosses":["care (close attention; concern)","care (maintenance, upkeep)","care (the treatment of those in need)"],"ipa":"/kwiˈdado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuidados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cuidado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Deberíamos haber tenido más cuidado.","en":"We should have been more careful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538056","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Los niños estaban bien cuidados.","en":"The children were well looked after.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932189","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"well"},null]},{"text":"Ten cuidado ahí fuera.","en":"Be careful out there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636672","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"outside, out"}]},{"text":"Siempre tengo cuidado.","en":"I'm always careful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448983","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"Cierra esa puerta con cuidado.","en":"Shut that door carefully.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598093","words":[{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"cerrar"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"with"},null]}]}